    "notes": [
      "Tempus is the representative item-shop board. Medal at source 90s shares the three-column structure and is documented as a variant rather than a second same-geometry board.",
      "Only the first six source slots are included. Four character-face offers and two further gear offers in lower source rows are omitted, not moved into invented products.",
      "The red-bottle and purple charm drawings are unavailable; redticket and gear glyphs are explicit generic proxies. Exact identity is not claimed.",
      "For source Medal variant: timer partially obscured by the recorded reward animation; observed first-row price/status and limits are 04:59 countdown with 2/3, gem×30 with 1/1, gem×120 with 5/5. Its exact native source text should be re-read if that separate board is later built.",
      "Shop footer keeps independent native text captions inside each of the four destination buttons at 14px. The back chevron is also a separate native caption because deleting the old combined string would otherwise remove it. Original nav pictograms remain omitted.",
      "텍스트 분리를 우선한 v003은 앞선 35행 가이드를 넘을 수 있습니다. 개별 글자가 해당 버튼 부모 안에 있으므로 단일 공백 문자열로 배치하지 않습니다.",
      "v004 artwork-only patch: Item1Icon → blue, Item3Icon → red, Item6Icon → bottle. Uses the newly drawn six-cell shop atlas; source item identity and exact original shape are not claimed. Text, quantities, duration, positions, parents, inputs and button behavior are unchanged.",
      "v005: source A frame 86 confirms Item6 is a red consumable bottle. Item6Icon alone now uses red-bottle atlas region [200,0,200,200]. All other actions, text, amounts, parents and input behavior remain unchanged.",
      "v007 shop-family footer: group420×82 at(0,842), observed Back input40×82 at x0, four destination tabs95×82 at x40/135/230/325. Separate native captions91×38,14px remain within their own tabs. This is not the global five84px-cell navigation specification; no fifth shop destination or relocated Back was invented.",
      "v007 native tab/filter/advance captions are children of their corresponding button, preserving two-part copy/reuse and the correct button input/state ownership.",
      "v008 omits the old whitespace CurrencyValues instruction. No replacement header group is embedded here. Root builds ACE_ShopCurrencyPatch in Limited and then uses normal UI copy/rebind for the other shop families; target-specific visible currencies and values must be rechecked."
    ],
